  "coder_notes": "Pan-tumour umbrella/basket trial (tailored therapy by FoundationOne profile vs physician's-choice SoC); glioblastoma named in inclusion criterion 8. All 25 tailored-therapy drugs are listed as experimental_combination because the experimental arm contains multiple investigational agents and each patient receives 'one or more' of them; some patients will effectively receive single-agent therapy, so role could be argued as monotherapy and regimen is coded unclear. Arm text lists INCB054828 for FGFR while interventions list pemigatinib; coded as pemigatinib. ROS1 (entrectinib) is folded into the NTRK row. 'Oncology Drugs' in the SoC arm are unnamed and coded control_comparator. Biomarker rows are per-drug assignment markers within the TT arm (enrichment); the overall entry requirement of an actionable alteration is coded as eligibility with uncertain=true."
}
